# Butler Routes - The Hinterlands (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (25 quests, docs/the-hinterlands-horde-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The two off-zone
# accepts (Belgrom's opener sits in Orgrimmar's contract; the Atal'ai pre and
# the Fel'zerul/oran follow-ups live in the Swamp pool or nowhere) are bridged
# with dedicated when onquest mini-steps or named handoffs, never duplicated.
# No race, class or profession gates: nothing contracted is locked, and the data
# carries no skill or class fields in the pool. Object-started chains (Rin'ji's
# Secret, the Venom Bottles, both wanted posters) ride normal accepts at their
# placed objects with notes so the route never wedges. Expedition legs and
# turn-ins (Orgrimmar, Swamp of Sorrows, Undercity, Tarren Mill) switch frames
# deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-hinterlands-horde
title The Hinterlands (Horde)
levels 38-46
zone The Hinterlands
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Revantusk muster - the east-coast hub

  zone map 1425

  tip Revantusk Village holds the east coast: Katoom the Angler (80.33, 81.54) works the bay; Huntsman Markhor (79.16, 79.53) runs the hunters; Smith Slagtree (77.23, 80.13), Lard (78.14, 81.38), Otho Moji'ko (79.38, 79.08) and Mystic Yayo'jin (78.8, 78.25) hold the village; Primal Torntusk (78.2, 81.18) leads; Qujo (77.95, 77.83) pays for a hunt; the Call to Arms! poster (79.08, 78.99) pins the board.
  accept 7815 -- Snapjaws, Mon! - Katoom the Angler; saltwater snapjaws, south shore
  accept 7816 -- Gammerita, Mon! - Katoom the Angler; Gammerita's lure, the bay
  accept 7828 -- Stalking the Stalkers - Huntsman Markhor; Silvermane wolves, west
  accept 7829 -- Hunt the Savages - Huntsman Markhor; savage owlbeasts, west
  accept 7830 -- Avenging the Fallen - Huntsman Markhor; a skylord plume, the rookery
  accept 7839 -- Vilebranch Hooligans - Smith Slagtree; lost tools, the troll grounds
  accept 7840 -- Lard Lost His Lunch - Lard; lunch west, the kidnappers' camp
  accept 7841 -- Message to the Wildhammer - Otho Moji'ko; Highvale scouts and runners, west
  accept 7844 -- Cannibalistic Cousins - Mystic Yayo'jin; scalpers and soothsayers, center ruins
  accept 7845 -- Kidnapped Elder Torntusk! - Primal Torntusk; the elder waits at Jintha'Alor, south
  accept 7849 -- Separation Anxiety - Huntsman Markhor; a skull and bones, south terraces
  accept 7850 -- Dark Vessels - Primal Torntusk; tainted vessels, south terraces
  accept 7861 -- Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions - the Call to Arms! poster; Hexx and her guard, Jintha'Alor
  accept 7862 -- Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village - the Call to Arms! poster; Vilebranch packs, the terraces
  accept 98203 -- Witch Doctor Ti'ik - Qujo; Ti'ik's head, west grounds

